						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p>了解基金会两年多直到20年下半年才开始画些东西，目前基本上是以插画为主。</p> <p>如果需要联络的话欢迎使用站内信，也可以去我的博客找我：Lofter@Olicus</p> <p>该页面也会长期更新，非常感谢你的留意。</p> <hr /> <h1><span>项目相关</span></h1> <h2><span><strong>SCP-105</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+“鸢娓”</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">画了外围《女生派对》里的那身：D</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/105" alt="105" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <h2><span><strong>SCP-166（新）</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+只是一位少女盖亚</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">“父亲。”</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/166" alt="166" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <h2><span><strong>SCP-3001</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+红现实</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">“留下我的心，只是心脏，我别无所求。”</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/3001" alt="3001" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <h2><span><strong>SCP-3997</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+我的终结即是新生</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">“我们都想回到一切是温暖、简单的时候，满是夏阳和翠草的时光。我们每个人都想重新沐浴在光明之下。但我们都做了自己的选择，我们都许下了自己的誓言。我们每个人都会在黑暗中死去，别无他法。”</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/3997" alt="3997" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <h2><span><strong>SCP-3998&amp;3999</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+柳条女巫不死&amp;我于万物之中</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">就像一出荒诞剧。</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/3998%263999" alt="3998%263999" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <h2><span><strong>SCP-3999</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+我于万物之中</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Like&nbsp;a&nbsp;humanoid&nbsp;melting&nbsp;like&nbsp;clams&nbsp;upon&nbsp;the&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;table.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/3999" alt="3999" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <h1><span>外围相关</span></h1> <h2><span><strong>Portraits Of Your Father.</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+父像映画</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">图片点开的话应该会变成另一个版本，wiki可能观看效果不太好，如果想看透明PNG的效果可以保存原图用电脑打开或前往我的lofter查看。</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><strong>▼透明PNG版本</strong><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/%E7%88%B6%E5%83%8F%E6%98%A0%E7%94%BB" alt="%E7%88%B6%E5%83%8F%E6%98%A0%E7%94%BB" class="image" /><br /> <strong>▼完整版本</strong><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/04/%E7%88%B6%E5%83%8F%E6%98%A0%E7%94%BB%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89" alt="父像映画%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <h1><span>人物相关</span></h1> <h2><span><strong>Talloran/Draven</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+没有基金会的一天</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">想要他们平静地生活。</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/Talloran_Draven%281%29" alt="Talloran_Draven%281%29" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+(*含有body&nbsp;horror内容)</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">花是白色桔梗，花语为永恒的爱/无望的爱。</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/Talloran_Draven%282%29" alt="Talloran_Draven%282%29" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <h1><span>其他</span></h1> <h2><span><strong>SCP×Fall Guys</strong></span></h2> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+Kondraki/Clef</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">鬼捉人！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/Kondraki_Clef" alt="Kondraki_Clef" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+Talloran/Draven</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">抢尾巴！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wdfiles.com/local--files/04/Talloran_Draven" alt="Talloran_Draven" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+Gears/Iceburg</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">瞎扒拉！</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/04/Gears_Iceburg" alt="Gears_Iceburg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/olicus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5321783&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606787877" alt="Olicus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5321783)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/olicus" >Olicus</a></span></p> 
